sequenceDiagram
    participant UI
    participant B as Backend
    UI->>B: POST /api/articles/{id}/push  (or /inspect)
    B-->>UI: 202 { jobId, status: "running" }
    loop every 2 s (max 60 s)
        UI->>B: GET /api/jobs/{jobId}
        alt still running
            B-->>UI: { status: "running" }
        else done
            B-->>UI: { status: "done", result }
            UI->>UI: stop polling; refresh data
        else error
            B-->>UI: { status: "error", error }
            UI->>UI: stop polling; show error toast
        end
    end